Named Pipe (FIFO)
-----------------

fifo - first in first out special file

When processes are exchanging data via the FIFO, the kernel passes all data internally without writing it to the file system.


How to create named pipe ?

1. Using mkfifo function
	
	int mkfifo(const char* path, mode_t mode);

2. Using mkfifo command

	$mkfifo name_of_the_named_pipe



